## 1. Trade Secret Notice
The underlying source code, algorithmic logic pipelines, multi-sport configuration metrics, and scoring weights contained within this repository constitute proprietary trade secrets. This information derives actual and potential independent economic value from not being generally known to public commercial markets.

This project claims full statutory trade secret protection under:
* The Texas Uniform Trade Secrets Act (TUTSA) (Tex. Civ. Prac. & Rem. Code Ch. 134A)
* The United States Defend Trade Secrets Act (DTSA) (18 U.S.C. § 1836)

## 2. International Provisions & WTO Compliance
Pursuant to Article 39 of the World Trade Organization (WTO) TRIPS Agreement (Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights), the undisclosed technical data, multi-sport metrics, source scripts, and tracking configurations herein are protected against unauthorized commercial use, disclosure, or misappropriation across all WTO member sovereign states.

## 3. Permitted Usage Restrictions
Permission is granted strictly for non-commercial educational review, local academic athletic experimentation, and open-source contribution under the terms of the project's parameters. Any unauthorized commercial exploitation, modification of analytics pipelines for third-party software platforms, or deployment of these specific tracking metrics in corporate athletic apps without an explicit commercial license from the copyright holders is strictly prohibited and subject to legal remedies, including statutory damages and injunctive relief.
